{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，Y在一眼抓关键词上明显不如X，X的【加亮词】更容易瞬间锁住转折和重点。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y左侧每段是一条能顺着读下去的因果线，右侧留下的感受也多半能落到身体、声音或动作上，所以边听音乐边扫时不容易被词堆打散；从舍不得、拿委屈提醒自己、重新动摇，到承认想念、最后先把日子过稳，前后很像同一件事在推进。X的关键词确实更快，但感受层连续得太密，特别在短段里容易让我还没分清哪一个细节最重要，下一个已经来了。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "df218460-f4f5-42d6-b18c-e796362525b8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T060104259137Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:01:31.570466+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d8db339aaf7098387830623a24f2a16748bcc743d06164437bd7e55bdda9f49a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"